# ACL for Eden users. Everything scoped under eden/#.
# ESP32 nodes: publish sensors/status/acks, subscribe to their commands.
user eden-node
topic write eden/+/status
topic write eden/+/sensor/#
topic write eden/+/telemetry
topic write eden/+/ack/#
topic read eden/+/cmd/#

# edend daemon: full eden tree.
user edend
topic readwrite eden/#
